Architecture Explanation
The system consists of four major layers:
1. User Layer: Faculty members, students, and administrators access the application using computers or mobile devices.
2. Application Layer: The cloud-hosted application processes login requests, attendance marking, report generation, and notifications.
3. Database Layer: Stores student details, faculty information, and attendance records.
4. Cloud Infrastructure Layer: Provides hosting, storage, security, backup, and scalability.
