7. Conclusion
The implementation of a SaaS-based cloud attendance management system helps colleges replace traditional manual attendance processes with an efficient digital solution. It provides centralized data storage, real-time attendance tracking, easy accessibility, reduced maintenance costs, and improved accuracy. Although security and internet dependency are major challenges, they can be addressed through proper security measures and offline synchronization.

Therefore, SaaS is an effective and scalable solution for modern college attendance management systems.

